  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Georgia&apos;s 2024 Parliamentary Elections</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to improve good governance, support more open, resilient and accountable institutions, rule of law, equal access to justice, human rights, and increased representation and participation of women in decision-making. The outcome is focused on increasing transparency and voter participation in the 2024 parliamentary elections.</narrative>
  </description>
